Third-party software

- debugpy (MIT License), a runtime dependency installed from PyPI; not included in
  Peeky's distributions.
- Microsoft java-debug (Eclipse Public License 1.0). `peeky setup-java` (src/peeky/java_setup.py)
  downloads its pinned source and runtime jars, applies one small patch whose text is in
  that module (eventhub-log-guard), and builds a local adapter bundle that keeps the
  upstream licence and notices. None of it is included in Peeky's distributions. See
  src/peeky/java_adapter/NOTICES.md.
- CPython 3.9.6's Lib/ipaddress.py (PSF License Agreement), copied as
  examples/real/ipaddress_mapped/ipaddress39.py with a notice of its origin added: a real
  program the tests debug. It is in Peeky's source distribution, with its licence in
  examples/real/ipaddress_mapped/LICENSE-PSF.
